    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluida is a simulation puzzle game where you are able to build and play levels made with flexible modules allowing you to control the pressure of water flowing trough in a strategic way to solve the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is far from being done!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modules can be set up to do whatever you want with the water they get, using a simple visual editor to control the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794990/extras/2239c7bb7ae138fc9f58268eef9267cd.avif?t=1754942251\" width=800 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluida includes a built in level designer which you can use to design levels with a combination of modules and pipes which can be programmed to input a set amount of water into a system or to expect a set behavior of the system to pass the level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORKSHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your level/module to the workshop for other people to play/use in their levels.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluida is a simulation puzzle game where you are able to build and play levels made with flexible modules allowing you to control the pressure of water flowing trough in a strategic way to solve the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is far from being done!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODULES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modules can be set up to do whatever you want with the water they get, using a simple visual editor to control the flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794990/extras/2239c7bb7ae138fc9f58268eef9267cd.avif?t=1754942251\" width=800 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluida includes a built in level designer which you can use to design levels with a combination of modules and pipes which can be programmed to input a set amount of water into a system or to expect a set behavior of the system to pass the level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORKSHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your level/module to the workshop for other people to play/use in their levels.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fluida is a simulation puzzle game where you build and play levels using flexible modules to strategically control water pressure and solve challenges.",
